  "description": "An organisation's policy-signing chain and host policy as the managed service signs them across a rotation of the policy-signing key. The service signs the policy it holds again under the new key, as the next revision with the same settings, so that a host that follows the new chain applies it. The cases are the chain and the policy before the rotation, and the chain and the policy after it.",
